00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:56.866
<v The Heroine>Tell them the truth about who it's for
and what you need, then compare the

00:16:56.866 --> 00:16:58.600
<v The Heroine>three drafts that come back.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:02.380
