00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:28.130
<v The Heroine>So remember, LAiDIES: you'll need more
than a cup of ambition to keep up in the

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:29.800
<v The Heroine>male-dominated world of AI.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:34.820
<v The Heroine>Lucky for you... this series comes in
